"brief":{"x":1900,"y":0,"w":380,"text":"Same day in every row: Prep 1, 'You don't have to quit today'.\n\n5 steps, 5–7 min each:\n1 · Audio, 6 min: Keep smoking. Just watch.\n2 · Cards, 5 min: Why the first one feels so good\n3 · Quiz, 5 min: Relief, or refill?\n4 · Exercise, 6 min: Three honest check-ins\n5 · Audio, 7 min: Tonight, what you noticed\n\nPersona: Sam, 12 cigarettes a day, Quit Day Fri 6 Nov. Step 1 done, step 2 next.\n\nPress Play on any board: links, flips, quiz answers and play/pause work.","fill":"orange","size":"m","page":"explore"},
"fRow1":{"x":0,"y":-260,"text":"F · The Deck: one day, played through (Prep 1)","kind":"title1","maxW":2270,"page":"final"},
"fRow2":{"x":0,"y":940,"text":"After a card, end of day, evening, Quit Day","kind":"title1","maxW":2270,"page":"final"},
"fBrief":{"x":2360,"y":0,"w":400,"text":"The mix: D's hand of cards and reveal grid, C's live-caption audio, D's myth-or-fact deck.\n\nEach day is a hand of 5 cards, 5–7 min each, about 30 min.\n\nCard colours by format:\n· Listen: apricot morning, violet evening\n· Reveal: sky\n· Myth or fact: sun\n· Try: mint (ocean when it's about cravings)\n· Breathe: periwinkle sky\n\nEvery card ends on a button in your own words ('I've felt that gap'), then an optional rating.\n\nCopy is draft and follows docs/program/00_PROGRAM_BIBLE.md.","fill":"orange","size":"m","page":"final"}
},
